OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn overcast day with patchy
OL,6,Frain or showers across the region. A
OL,7,Fmisty start, especially across higher
OL,8,Fground. Rain will be mostly drizzly
OL,9,Fbut the odd heavier burst is possible.
OL,10,FLight winds and feeling cold.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy and damp start to the
OL,13,Fnight with some rain, with little
OL,14,Fchange likely through the night. Some
OL,15,Fmist and fog returning, mostly across
OL,16,Fhills. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
