OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FOutbreaks of light rain
OL,6,Faffecting most areas will move
OL,7,Fsouthwards to leave a drier and
OL,8,Fpossibly brighter end to Thursday
OL,9,Facross northern areas. Drier overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,12,Fdry with some sunshine Friday and
OL,13,FSaturday but a chance of coastal
OL,14,Fshowers. Temperatures near or below
OL,15,Fnormal. Mostly light winds. Cloudier
OL,16,Fwith rain probable later on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
